d:A strange binary drop was recovered from a secured embedded system. The data is entirely unrecognized by our standard analysis tools, suggesting the developers went out of their way to build a completely closed, proprietary ecosystem. 
Alongside the firmware, forensics managed to salvage a partially corrupted text file from a damaged sector on a developer's machine. 
Find a way inside the black box, piece together the undocumented architecture, and retrieve the flag.
